/14/football-oklahoma-state-game-to-be-televised-at-7-pm-et-on-fs1</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="OKStateGameAnnouncement" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/14/GameTimeAnnouncementOKSUWEB.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that WVU's Sept. 26 Big 12 Conference football game against Oklahoma State will be televised at 7 p.m., ET, on FS1.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/14/GameTimeAnnouncementOKSUWEB.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/14/GameTimeAnnouncementOKSUWEB.jpg"><media:title>OKStateGameAnnouncement</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/14/GameTimeAnnouncementOKSUWEB.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:09:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59393</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Announce 2026 Fall Tournament Schedule</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/14/tennis-mountaineers-announce-2026-fall-tournament-schedule</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/14/tennis-mountaineers-announce-2026-fall-tournament-schedule</guid><category>Tennis</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU announces the 2026 tennis fall tournament schedule" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/14/16x9.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia tennis team announced its fall 2026 tournament schedule on Monday.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/ima